# Pairs with LinkObligationDurable. The root acknowledges the donor before its
# link intent is durable, so the marker is retired while nothing else records
# the obligation.
MODULE: LinkObligationDurableEarlyAcknowledge
TARGET: LinkObligationDurable
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the marker is retired before the link intent is durable
PERTURBS: Acknowledge

--- FIND
    /\ marker /\ (pending \/ linked)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: acknowledged without a durable intent.
    /\ marker
--- END
